1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:02,020
Closing sering lupa dicatat.

2
00:00:02,020 --> 00:00:03,640
Iklan pun tidak pernah tahu.

3
00:00:06,100 --> 00:00:10,568
Buka Aturan Otomatisasi, lalu
buat aturan baru.

4
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:15,290
Syaratnya: pesan pelanggan
mengandung "sudah transfer".

5
00:00:17,800 --> 00:00:22,375
Aksinya: ambil nominal dari pesan, lalu
ubah status jadi Closing.

6
00:00:24,400 --> 00:00:24,808
Simpan.

7
00:00:24,808 --> 00:00:26,267
Aturannya langsung aktif.

8
00:00:27,800 --> 00:00:30,623
Pelanggan chat: sudah transfer Rp 750.000.

9
00:00:32,200 --> 00:00:35,715
Status jadi Closing, nilainya
terisi sendiri.

10
00:00:35,715 --> 00:00:36,184
Beres!

11
00:00:38,200 --> 00:00:41,118
Lalu Purchase terkirim ke Meta,
tanpa klik apa pun.

12
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:45,250
Pakai kalimat yang khas,
jangan kata pendek.

13
00:00:48,600 --> 00:00:50,713
Panduannya, di konektor.id.
